#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニター…
#. 今は校章が浮かんでいるだけだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on.\n"
"Right now, it's just showing the school crest.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 気にしてもしょうがない、放っておこう。
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"There's not much point in worrying about it now. I\n"
"should try to just forget about it..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>監視カメラなんか気にしてても仕方がない…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's no point in worrying about a surveillance\n"
"camera now...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. こんなに大きい機械が…ただの空気清浄機なのか…
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"A huge machine like this... Could it really be *just*\n"
"an air purifier?"
msgstr ""

#. くだらないにも程があるな…
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "That just seems silly..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>物理の実験とかで使う物か…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>They must use these for physics experiments and\n"
"stuff...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>事件には…関係ないか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's not really related to the case, though...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なんかの機械って事はわかるけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This machine obviously has some kind of purpose,\n"
"but...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そもそも、物理が何かよくわからないボクに、
#. この機械を理解するのは難しそうだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...I don't know anything about physics to begin with,\n"
"so I wouldn't have a clue where to start with this.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0010 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0011 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
